1     Introduction

1.1   Problem Background
   Global extreme weather events have been on the rise, a trend expected to worsen, as




                                                                       型
per meteorologists [1]. Instances of hurricanes, floods, droughts, and wildfires are in-
creasing, leading to more severe impacts on lives, property, ecosystems, and economies.
“Climate change is a terrible problem, and it deserves to be a huge priority” said Bill




                                                         模
Gates, calling for global attention to climate issues.




                                                        学
                                                数
                                   ：

                                                            els
                                  号

                                                          od
                          众

